WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.253 --> 00:00:05.505
Good job coming here on your own.

00:00:05.588 --> 00:00:07.048
Wasn't it dangerous for you?

00:00:07.132 --> 00:00:10.760
What? It's not more dangerous
than Karino in that state.

00:00:10.844 --> 00:00:12.220
Haha.

00:00:12.303 --> 00:00:17.892
Anyway, do you need money that badly,
coming into work on a Sunday?

00:00:17.976 --> 00:00:20.020
Haha. You're mistaken.

00:00:20.603 --> 00:00:23.314
I just have work I need to finish
by the end of the day.

00:00:23.398 --> 00:00:25.775
I come in on weekends every now and then.

00:00:26.276 --> 00:00:28.778
I see, so you are busy.

00:00:28.862 --> 00:00:31.906
Your face always seems glazed over.

00:00:31.990 --> 00:00:33.658
You must be tired.

00:00:33.742 --> 00:00:34.868
Haha.

00:00:34.951 --> 00:00:37.078
Are you eating properly?

00:00:37.162 --> 00:00:39.622
Eating is most important when you're busy.

00:00:39.706 --> 00:00:43.418
Haha. This feels like counseling.

00:00:43.501 --> 00:00:44.919
It's okay.

00:00:45.003 --> 00:00:47.505
My wife takes care of me in that regard.

00:00:47.630 --> 00:00:48.465
Huh?

00:00:48.548 --> 00:00:49.466
Huh?

00:00:49.549 --> 00:00:51.384
You were able to get married?

00:00:52.010 --> 00:00:55.680
Haha. What do you mean?

00:00:55.764 --> 00:00:59.184
Well, you are quite skilled
at your job, after all.

00:00:59.267 --> 00:01:00.977
"After all"?

00:01:01.686 --> 00:01:03.813
By the way, I have kids too.

00:01:05.940 --> 00:01:07.567
You should go home right now!

00:01:07.650 --> 00:01:11.988
Your kids must be lonely
when you're working on a Sunday.

00:01:12.072 --> 00:01:13.823
Okay, you should go!

00:01:15.325 --> 00:01:18.411
Haha. You're hitting a sore spot.

00:01:20.747 --> 00:01:22.791
Want to take a field trip?

00:01:22.874 --> 00:01:23.708
Huh?

00:01:23.792 --> 00:01:27.045
We have an editing department
for a kids' toy magazine.

00:01:27.128 --> 00:01:29.297
There are some pretty interesting items.

00:01:29.380 --> 00:01:31.508
I do not require a field trip.

00:01:31.591 --> 00:01:34.135
I believe there's also
some Tonosaman merchandise.

00:01:36.471 --> 00:01:37.680
It can't be helped.

00:01:37.764 --> 00:01:41.392
If you allow me to view just that,
I'll leave shortly thereafter.

00:01:41.476 --> 00:01:42.727
Haha.

00:01:48.900 --> 00:01:52.612
Well, Sir Fukuno,
you must be satisfied showing me this.

00:01:52.695 --> 00:01:54.364
Hurry up and go home now.

00:01:54.447 --> 00:01:56.825
Haha. He can't take his eyes off this.

00:01:56.908 --> 00:01:59.327
There's also
a big game machine over there.

00:02:00.245 --> 00:02:02.372
I don't need video games. I'm going home.

00:02:08.419 --> 00:02:09.546
Do you like it?

00:02:09.629 --> 00:02:13.550
Don't misunderstand me. I am just
checking the condition of the machine.

00:02:13.633 --> 00:02:14.634
Haha.

00:02:15.385 --> 00:02:19.639
Speaking of which, I believe
we have a two meter tall Tonosaman doll.

00:02:24.644 --> 00:02:28.064
This is the Happy Dance Tonosaman
that was on display

00:02:28.148 --> 00:02:29.774
at the anime anniversary event!

00:02:29.858 --> 00:02:31.734
It's my first time seeing it in person!

00:02:31.818 --> 00:02:33.361
It is amazing!

00:02:36.739 --> 00:02:39.909
Sir Fukuno,
you should not be entertaining me.

00:02:40.618 --> 00:02:44.122
Isn't this a disservice to your children?

00:02:44.205 --> 00:02:47.333
Hmm. He's a tough nut to crack.

